Set x to 0. While x is less than 6: Add 1 to x. If x is equal to 2 then: Continue. End if. Say x. If x is equal to 4 then: Break. End if. End while. Say x. Set r to 0. Repeat 5: Add 1 to r. If r is equal to 2 then: Continue. End if. Say r. If r is equal to 3 then: Break. End if. End repeat. Say r. Set xs to List with 1 followed by 2 followed by 3 followed by 4 done. For each item in xs: If item is equal to 2 then: Continue. End if. Say item. If item is equal to 3 then: Break. End if. End for.
